# First POST /auth/session with Origin: http://127.0.0.1:8080 and a demo
# credential in Authorization. Copy the opaque token from Set-Cookie into the
# actor variables below. Business routes never accept bootstrap credentials.
@base = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@alice = PASTE_ALICE_SESSION_TOKEN
@bob = PASTE_BOB_SESSION_TOKEN
@carol = PASTE_CAROL_SESSION_TOKEN
@purchaseID = replace-with-created-id

### Create a draft (201). Organization comes from verified membership, never body.
POST {{base}}/api/purchases
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}
X-Organization-ID: northstar
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Annual microscope calibration","amount_cents":48000}

### Creator submits draft (200)
POST {{base}}/api/purchases/{{purchaseID}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}
X-Organization-ID: northstar

### Another approver decides (200)
POST {{base}}/api/purchases/{{purchaseID}}/decision
Authorization: Bearer {{bob}}
X-Organization-ID: northstar
Content-Type: application/json

{"decision":"approved"}

### Alice's requests only
GET {{base}}/api/purchases
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}
X-Organization-ID: northstar

### Same actor, another authorized organization: Northstar request is hidden (404)
GET {{base}}/api/purchases/{{purchaseID}}
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}
X-Organization-ID: harbor

### Client-visible flags (no-store); does not grant export permission
GET {{base}}/api/features
Authorization: Bearer {{bob}}
X-Organization-ID: northstar

### JSON export (403 unless startup feature is enabled)
GET {{base}}/api/purchases/export
Authorization: Bearer {{bob}}
X-Organization-ID: northstar
Accept-Encoding: gzip

### Personal audit history
GET {{base}}/api/audit
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}
X-Organization-ID: northstar

### Organization audit history
GET {{base}}/api/audit
Authorization: Bearer {{bob}}
X-Organization-ID: northstar

### Administrator lists organization members
GET {{base}}/api/memberships
Authorization: Bearer {{carol}}
X-Organization-ID: northstar

### Administrator changes another existing member's role
PATCH {{base}}/api/memberships/alice
Authorization: Bearer {{carol}}
X-Organization-ID: northstar
Content-Type: application/json

{"role":"approver"}
